    "detailed_description": "Are you tired of the hassle to copy and paste your text to a website in order to convert it to your desired Unicode text?<br />\r\nDo you want to directly input Unicode styled text into an application window?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThen UniFont Writer is the best fit for you!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith UniFont Writer you can directly input Unicode styled text to any application window that supports Unicode text encoding.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJust select one of the available fontsets, toggle the tool and then type in your text. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdditionally you can create your own fontsets and use them with UniFont Writer.",
    "about_the_game": "Are you tired of the hassle to copy and paste your text to a website in order to convert it to your desired Unicode text?<br />\r\nDo you want to directly input Unicode styled text into an application window?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThen UniFont Writer is the best fit for you!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith UniFont Writer you can directly input Unicode styled text to any application window that supports Unicode text encoding.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJust select one of the available fontsets, toggle the tool and then type in your text. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdditionally you can create your own fontsets and use them with UniFont Writer.",
    "short_description": "UniFont Writer enables you to directly input Unicode styled text in any application that supports Unicode text encoding. This way you don't have to copy and paste it into a converter tool/website. Instead you can just directly type into an application window.",
